WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.995
Har bill haath se type karna zaroori nahi.

2
00:00:12.035 --> 00:00:18.744
Zyaadatar distributors apna bill e-bill file
mein bhi dete hain, CSV, Excel ya text mein.

3
00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:23.824
Supplier tools ki E-bill import se yeh file
seedhe padhi jaati hai.

4
00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:32.751
Ek zaroori baat: PDF ya photo wale bill ko scan
karne wala AI feature Medoro server par OCR
engine se chalta hai.

5
00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:35.951
Is demo server par OCR engine juda nahi hai,

6
00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:39.733
isliye yahan hum e-bill file import dikha rahe
hain.

7
00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:46.008
Pehle supplier chuniye, phir 'Choose bill file'
se distributor ki file chuniye.

8
00:00:46.048 --> 00:00:50.712
Hamaare paas Jharkhand Medical Agencies ki ek
demo e-bill file hai.

9
00:00:51.472 --> 00:00:58.023
Medoro file ke columns pehchaanta hai: item ka
naam, batch, expiry, quantity,

10
00:00:58.063 --> 00:01:00.847
free quantity, rate, MRP aur GST.

11
00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:05.555
Har line ko catalogue ki medicine se milaaya
jaata hai.

12
00:01:06.318 --> 00:01:09.262
Post karne se pehle review zaroori hai.

13
00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:16.073
Har line ki medicine, batch, expiry, maatra aur
rate supplier ke kaagzi bill se milaaiye.

14
00:01:16.113 --> 00:01:22.118
Koi medicine na mile, to use sahi medicine se
jodiye ya nayi medicine banaaiye.

15
00:01:22.867 --> 00:01:26.372
Sab sahi ho to bill number daalkar save kijiye.

16
00:01:26.412 --> 00:01:31.803
Stock, batches aur supplier ka bakaaya, teeno ek
saath update hote hain.
